                    Repeated to London, Paris, Amman, Beirut, Baghdad, Cairo, and Damascus.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d28-f2" n="2" xml:id="d28-f2-content">
                <p>A memorandum of Lawson’s conversation with Eban was transmitted as an enclosure
